<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=1440, initial-scale=1">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:,">
  <title>KrishiChain - ER and Relational Schema Solution</title>
  <style>
    :root { --navy:#1d4b2c; --blue:#dcecdc; --line:#17202a; --paper:#fff; --page:#eef1e9; --muted:#556355; --gold:#f4e4a4; }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; }
    body { min-width:1440px; margin:0; background:var(--page); color:#182331; font:16px/1.5 Arial,sans-serif; }
    header, main { width:min(1880px,calc(100% - 32px)); margin:auto; }
    header { padding:32px 8px 22px; }
    h1 { margin:0; color:var(--navy); font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,52px); letter-spacing:-.025em; }
    header p { max-width:1040px; margin:8px 0 0; color:var(--muted); }
    nav { display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-top:18px; }
    nav a { color:var(--navy); background:white; border:1px solid #bccdbc; padding:7px 12px; text-decoration:none; font-weight:700; }
    section { background:var(--paper); border:1px solid #c6d2c6; margin:0 0 24px; padding:24px; box-shadow:0 8px 28px #2b3f2b14; }
    h2 { color:var(--navy); margin:0 0 6px; font-size:28px; }
    .intro { margin:0 0 18px; color:var(--muted); }
    .diagram-scroll { overflow-x:auto; border:1px solid #a6bba6; background:#fff; }
    .diagram-export { min-width:1200px; background:white; padding:18px; }
    svg { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; }
    svg text { fill:#111; font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif; }
    .entity, .relation-table { fill:#f8fbf8; stroke:var(--line); stroke-width:2; }
    .entity-head, .table-head { fill:var(--blue); stroke:var(--line); stroke-width:2; }
    .relationship { fill:#f2f5f1; stroke:var(--line); stroke-width:2; }
    .attribute { fill:white; stroke:var(--line); stroke-width:1.7; }
    .connector { fill:none; stroke:var(--line); stroke-width:2; }
    .thin { stroke-width:1.5; }
    .dash { stroke-dasharray:9 7; }
    .label { font-size:18px; text-anchor:middle; dominant-baseline:middle; }
    .small { font-size:15px; }
    .tiny { font-size:13px; }
    .bold { font-weight:700; }
    .key { text-decoration:underline; font-weight:700; }
    .partial-key { text-decoration-line:underline; text-decoration-style:dashed; font-weight:700; }
    .legend { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(210px,1fr)); gap:8px 20px; margin-top:16px; padding:13px 16px; background:#f3f7f3; border-left:5px solid var(--navy); font-size:14px; }
    .legend b { color:var(--navy); }
    .mapping { margin-top:18px; padding:14px 18px; background:#fff9df; border:1px solid #dbc977; }
    .guide-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap:16px; margin-top:18px; }
    .guide-card { border:1px solid #bccdbc; background:#fbfdfb; padding:16px; }
    .guide-card h3 { margin:0 0 8px; color:var(--navy); font-size:20px; }
    .guide-card ul, .guide-card ol { margin:8px 0 0; padding-left:22px; }
    .guide-card li { margin:0 0 7px; }
    .mini-diagram { margin-top:12px; border:1px solid #cddccd; background:#fff; overflow-x:auto; }
    .mini-diagram svg { min-width:520px; }
    .construct-grid { display:grid; gap:18px; margin-top:18px; }
    .construct { border:1px solid #bccdbc; background:#fbfdfb; padding:16px; }
    .construct h3 { margin:0 0 4px; color:var(--navy); font-size:20px; }
    .construct p { margin:0 0 10px; color:var(--muted); font-size:14px; }
    .construct .holder { border:1px solid #cddccd; background:#fff; overflow-x:auto; }
    .construct .holder svg { min-width:760px; }
    .assumptions { columns:2; column-gap:42px; margin:14px 0 0; }
    .assumptions li { break-inside:avoid; margin:0 0 10px; }
    footer { width:min(1880px,calc(100% - 32px)); margin:0 auto 30px; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; }
    @media (max-width:700px) { header,main,footer{width:min(1880px,calc(100% - 32px))} section{padding:24px}.assumptions{columns:2}.diagram-export{min-width:1200px} }
    @media print { body{background:white} header,main,footer{width:100%} nav{display:none} section{box-shadow:none;border:0;page-break-after:always}.diagram-scroll{overflow:visible}.diagram-export{min-width:0;padding:0} }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>KrishiChain</h1>
    <p>Agricultural supply chain from farm to virtual arat to buyer. Complete Chen E-R model, mapped relational schema for 27 tables, and explicit assumptions. Notation and connector direction follow the supplied textbook examples.</p>
    <nav><a href="#task-a">Task A: E-R Diagram</a><a href="#constructs">Graded Constructs</a><a href="#task-b">Task B: Schema Diagram</a><a href="#task-c">Task C: Assumptions</a><a href="#guide">How to Convert</a></nav>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section id="task-a">
      <h2>Task A - E-R Diagram</h2>
      <p class="intro">Chen notation. Cardinalities sit next to relationship edges; double lines mark total participation. Entities carry their key attribute; the constructs that carry marks — composite, multivalued and derived attributes, the specialization, both aggregations, both ternaries, both weak entities and both recursive relationships — are drawn in full.</p>
      <div class="diagram-scroll"><div class="diagram-export" id="er-export">
