    <section id="constructs">
      <h2>The Five Graded Constructs</h2>
      <p class="intro">Each construct on its own, at readable size. These are the parts an examiner will ask about, so the reasoning is stated next to each one.</p>
      <div class="construct-grid">
        <article class="construct">
          <h3>1. Total, disjoint specialization</h3>
          <p>USERS splits into five subclasses. Total, because every account is one of them; disjoint, because none is two at once.</p>
          <div class="holder"><svg viewBox="0 0 1240 460" aria-label="Specialization">
<text class="label bold" x="620" y="26" style="font-size:17px;fill:#1d4b2c">Total, disjoint specialization</text>
<rect class="entity" x="490" y="60" width="250" height="66"/>
<text class="label bold" x="615.0" y="93.0" style="font-size:18px">USERS</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="230" cy="92" rx="40" ry="25"/>
<text class="label key" x="230" y="92" style="font-size:13px">UserID</text>
<path class="connector thin" d="M285 92 H490"/>
<path class="connector" d="M612 126 L612 190"/><path class="connector" d="M618 126 L618 190"/>
<polygon points="615,190 545,262 685,262" fill="#e3efe3" stroke="#17202a" stroke-width="2"/>
<text class="label bold" x="615" y="240" style="font-size:18px">d</text>
<text x="760" y="226" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">total: every user is exactly one subclass</text>
<path class="connector" d="M615 262 V300"/>
<path class="connector" d="M120 300 H1060"/>
<path class="connector" d="M120 300 V340"/>
<rect class="entity" x="20" y="340" width="200" height="60"/>
<text class="label bold" x="120.0" y="370.0" style="font-size:13px">FARMER</text>
<path class="connector" d="M350 300 V340"/>
<rect class="entity" x="250" y="340" width="200" height="60"/>
<text class="label bold" x="350.0" y="361.0" style="font-size:13px">STORAGE</text>
<text class="label bold" x="350.0" y="380.0" style="font-size:13px">MANAGER</text>
<path class="connector" d="M590 300 V340"/>
<rect class="entity" x="490" y="340" width="200" height="60"/>
<text class="label bold" x="590.0" y="370.0" style="font-size:13px">BUYER</text>
<path class="connector" d="M830 300 V340"/>
<rect class="entity" x="730" y="340" width="200" height="60"/>
<text class="label bold" x="830.0" y="361.0" style="font-size:13px">ADMIN</text>
<text class="label bold" x="830.0" y="380.0" style="font-size:13px">STAFF</text>
<path class="connector" d="M1060 300 V340"/>
<rect class="entity" x="960" y="340" width="200" height="60"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1060.0" y="361.0" style="font-size:13px">TRANSPORT</text>
<text class="label bold" x="1060.0" y="380.0" style="font-size:13px">PERSONNEL</text>
<text x="615" y="430" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">Shared-PK subclass tables — subclass PK is also FK to USERS. No discriminator column.</text>
</svg></div>
        </article>
        <article class="construct">
          <h3>2. Aggregation</h3>
          <p>SALE_ORDER relates to a relationship, not to an entity. Ask what a sale order refers to and the answer is the whole buyer-bid-batch fact.</p>
          <div class="holder"><svg viewBox="0 0 1240 492" aria-label="Aggregation">
<text class="label bold" x="620" y="26" style="font-size:17px;fill:#1d4b2c">Aggregation</text>
<rect x="40" y="60" width="700" height="345" fill="none" stroke="#2f7d52" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="12 8"/>
<text class="label bold small" x="390" y="86" style="fill:#2f7d52;font-size:13px">the fact that this buyer's bid on this batch won</text>
<rect class="entity" x="80" y="130" width="190" height="58"/>
<text class="label bold" x="175.0" y="159.0" style="font-size:15px">BUYER</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="314,159 370,129 426,159 370,189"/>
<text class="label bold" x="370" y="159" style="font-size:12px">places</text>
<rect class="entity" x="510" y="130" width="190" height="58"/>
<text class="label bold" x="605.0" y="159.0" style="font-size:15px">BID</text>
<path class="connector" d="M270 159 H314"/>
<text class="label bold" x="288" y="142" style="font-size:16px">1</text>
<path class="connector" d="M426 162 L510 162"/><path class="connector" d="M426 156 L510 156"/>
<text class="label bold" x="468" y="142" style="font-size:16px">N</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="557,246 605,218 653,246 605,274"/>
<text class="label bold" x="605" y="246" style="font-size:12px">on</text>
<path class="connector" d="M602 188 L602 218"/><path class="connector" d="M608 188 L608 218"/>
<text class="label bold" x="628" y="204" style="font-size:16px">N</text>
<rect class="entity" x="490" y="302" width="230" height="62"/>
<text class="label bold" x="605.0" y="333.0" style="font-size:14px">HARVEST_BATCH</text>
<path class="connector" d="M605 274 V302"/>
<text class="label bold" x="628" y="290" style="font-size:16px">1</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="778,210 840,178 902,210 840,242"/>
<text class="label bold" x="840" y="210" style="font-size:12px">creates</text>
<path class="connector" d="M740 210 H778"/>
<text class="label bold" x="756" y="192" style="font-size:16px">1</text>
<rect class="entity" x="990" y="180" width="220" height="62"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1100.0" y="211.0" style="font-size:15px">SALE_ORDER</text>
<path class="connector" d="M902 212 L990 212"/><path class="connector" d="M902 208 L990 208"/>
<text class="label bold" x="946" y="192" style="font-size:16px">1</text>
<text x="620" y="442" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">The line leaves the dashed box, not the BID rectangle: SALE_ORDER relates to the whole buyer-bid-batch fact.</text>
<text x="620" y="466" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">UQ(SALE_ORDER.BidID) enforces the 1:1.</text>
</svg></div>
        </article>
        <article class="construct">
          <h3>3. Two ternary relationships</h3>
          <p>Three participants decided in one act. Decomposing either into binaries loses the accountability link.</p>
          <div class="holder"><svg viewBox="0 0 1280 500" aria-label="Ternary relationships">
<text class="label bold" x="620" y="26" style="font-size:17px;fill:#1d4b2c">Two ternary relationships</text>
<rect class="entity" x="30" y="90" width="200" height="58"/>
<text class="label bold" x="130.0" y="119.0" style="font-size:13px">HARVEST_BATCH</text>
<rect class="entity" x="30" y="300" width="200" height="58"/>
<text class="label bold" x="130.0" y="329.0" style="font-size:13px">STORAGE_UNIT</text>
<rect class="entity" x="330" y="400" width="220" height="58"/>
<text class="label bold" x="440.0" y="429.0" style="font-size:12px">STORAGE_MANAGER</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="240,224 330,174 420,224 330,274"/>
<text class="label bold" x="330" y="224" style="font-size:14px">STORES</text>
<path class="connector" d="M230 119 L262 190"/>
<text class="label bold" x="232" y="160" style="font-size:16px">M</text>
<path class="connector" d="M230 329 L266 258"/>
<text class="label bold" x="232" y="300" style="font-size:16px">N</text>
<path class="connector" d="M370 274 L420 400"/>
<text class="label bold" x="410" y="348" style="font-size:16px">P</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="200" cy="60" rx="64" ry="24"/>
<text class="label" x="200" y="60" style="font-size:12px">QuantityStored</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="470" cy="96" rx="40" ry="24"/>
<text class="label" x="470" y="96" style="font-size:12px">DateIn</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="540" cy="170" rx="40" ry="24"/>
<text class="label" x="540" y="170" style="font-size:12px">DateOut</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="560" cy="250" rx="71" ry="24"/>
<text class="label" x="560" y="250" style="font-size:12px">AllocationStatus</text>
<path class="connector thin" d="M240 82 L300 178"/>
<path class="connector thin" d="M432 112 L372 186"/>
<path class="connector thin" d="M501 174 L404 206"/>
<path class="connector thin" d="M493 248 L416 234"/>
<text x="300" y="480" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">Drops which manager authorised the allocation if split into binaries.</text>
<rect class="entity" x="700" y="90" width="230" height="58"/>
<text class="label bold" x="815.0" y="119.0" style="font-size:12px">TRANSPORT_REQUEST</text>
<rect class="entity" x="700" y="300" width="200" height="58"/>
<text class="label bold" x="800.0" y="329.0" style="font-size:13px">VEHICLE</text>
<rect class="entity" x="990" y="400" width="240" height="58"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1110.0" y="429.0" style="font-size:11px">TRANSPORT_PERSONNEL</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="900,224 1000,174 1100,224 1000,274"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1000" y="224" style="font-size:13px">ASSIGNED_TO</text>
<path class="connector" d="M930 119 L905 190"/>
<text class="label bold" x="902" y="160" style="font-size:16px">M</text>
<path class="connector" d="M900 329 L920 262"/>
<text class="label bold" x="902" y="300" style="font-size:16px">N</text>
<path class="connector" d="M1050 270 L1090 400"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1080" y="348" style="font-size:16px">P</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="1150" cy="120" rx="57" ry="24"/>
<text class="label" x="1150" y="120" style="font-size:12px">AssignedDate</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="1180" cy="200" rx="71" ry="24"/>
<text class="label" x="1180" y="200" style="font-size:12px">AssignmentStatus</text>
<path class="connector thin" d="M1093 132 L1048 184"/>
<path class="connector thin" d="M1109 206 L1098 220"/>
<text x="960" y="480" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">One trip = one request + one vehicle + one driver, decided together.</text>
</svg></div>
        </article>
        <article class="construct">
          <h3>4. Two weak entities</h3>
          <p>Neither child can be identified without its owner, so each takes the owner key plus a partial key, drawn with a dashed underline.</p>
          <div class="holder"><svg viewBox="0 0 1700 340" aria-label="Weak entities">
<text class="label bold" x="620" y="26" style="font-size:17px;fill:#1d4b2c">Two weak entities</text>
<rect class="entity" x="60" y="90" width="230" height="60"/>
<text class="label bold" x="175.0" y="120.0" style="font-size:15px">WAREHOUSE</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="334,120 400,86 466,120 400,154"/>
<polygon class="relationship" fill="none" points="343,120 400,92 457,120 400,148"/>
<text class="label bold" x="400" y="120" style="font-size:12px">contains</text>
<path class="connector" d="M290 120 H334"/>
<text class="label bold" x="308" y="102" style="font-size:16px">1</text>
<rect class="entity" x="530" y="88" width="230" height="66"/>
<rect class="entity" x="537" y="95" width="216" height="52" fill="none"/>
<text class="label bold" x="645.0" y="121.0" style="font-size:14px">STORAGE_UNIT</text>
<path class="connector" d="M466 122 L530 122"/><path class="connector" d="M466 118 L530 118"/>
<text class="label bold" x="496" y="102" style="font-size:16px">N</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="400" cy="230" rx="40" ry="25"/>
<text class="label partial-key" x="400" y="230" style="font-size:13px">UnitNo</text>
<path class="connector thin" d="M540 154 L452 208"/>
<text x="400" y="288" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">Partial key: unique only inside its warehouse.</text>
<text x="400" y="310" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">Real identifier is (WarehouseID, UnitNo).</text>
<rect class="entity" x="880" y="90" width="250" height="60"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1005.0" y="120.0" style="font-size:14px">PHYSICAL_BAZAR</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="1186,120 1250,86 1314,120 1250,154"/>
<polygon class="relationship" fill="none" points="1195,120 1250,92 1305,120 1250,148"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1250" y="120" style="font-size:12px">records</text>
<path class="connector" d="M1130 120 H1186"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1156" y="102" style="font-size:16px">1</text>
<rect class="entity" x="1380" y="88" width="270" height="66"/>
<rect class="entity" x="1387" y="95" width="256" height="52" fill="none"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1515.0" y="121.0" style="font-size:12px">BAZAR_DAILY_RECORD</text>
<path class="connector" d="M1314 122 L1380 122"/><path class="connector" d="M1314 118 L1380 118"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1344" y="102" style="font-size:16px">N</text>
<ellipse class="attribute" cx="1250" cy="230" rx="53" ry="25"/>
<text class="label partial-key" x="1250" y="230" style="font-size:13px">RecordDate</text>
<path class="connector thin" d="M1392 154 L1310 210"/>
<text x="1260" y="288" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">Identifier is (BazarID, RecordDate).</text>
<text x="1260" y="310" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">Both weak children cascade on owner delete.</text>
</svg></div>
        </article>
        <article class="construct">
          <h3>5. Two recursive relationships</h3>
          <p>Both are an entity related to itself, so both edges need role labels to say which end is which.</p>
          <div class="holder"><svg viewBox="0 0 1400 340" aria-label="Recursive relationships">
<text class="label bold" x="620" y="26" style="font-size:17px;fill:#1d4b2c">Two recursive relationships</text>
<rect class="entity" x="120" y="150" width="250" height="66"/>
<text class="label bold" x="245.0" y="183.0" style="font-size:16px">VIRTUAL_ARAT</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="354,80 430,46 506,80 430,114"/>
<text class="label bold" x="430" y="80" style="font-size:12px">supervises</text>
<path class="connector" d="M200 150 V80 H354"/>
<path class="connector" d="M506 80 H570 V190 H370"/>
<text x="232" y="62" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">parent (1)</text>
<text x="430" y="210" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">child (N)</text>
<text x="300" y="290" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">ARAT hierarchy — queried with CONNECT BY NOCYCLE.</text>
<text x="300" y="312" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">ParentAratID is a self-referencing FK, NULL at the root.</text>
<rect class="entity" x="830" y="150" width="250" height="66"/>
<text class="label bold" x="955.0" y="183.0" style="font-size:16px">BID</text>
<polygon class="relationship" points="1072,80 1140,46 1208,80 1140,114"/>
<text class="label bold" x="1140" y="80" style="font-size:12px">outbids</text>
<path class="connector" d="M910 150 V80 H1072"/>
<path class="connector" d="M1208 80 H1280 V190 H1080"/>
<text x="942" y="62" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">displacing bid (1)</text>
<text x="1140" y="210" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:start;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">outbid (1)</text>
<text x="1030" y="290" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">Outbid chain — PreviousBidID points at the bid this one displaced.</text>
<text x="1030" y="312" style="font-size:12px;text-anchor:middle;dominant-baseline:middle;fill:#4a5c6d">Seeded NULL then UPDATEd, because the FK is self-referencing.</text>
</svg></div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="task-b">
